// Shared, committed defaults. Put your own values in Config/Local.xcconfig
// (gitignored; copy Local.xcconfig.example). Only public config here: the
// Auth0 domain and native client id are not secrets.
// Note: "//" starts a comment in xcconfig, so URLs use "/$()/".

